  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)</p>\n<p><em>“No, you don’t need to eat actual fiber for the hyper-nanobots to work. Different kind of fiber. You will need to eat more silicon, though.”</em></p>\n<p><strong>Skinweave/Fleshweave Cyberware Enhancement.</strong> The skinweave’s SP is increased to SP 9, and its SP is no longer halved by Martial Arts Attacks but is still halved by Melee Weapons and charged Tech Rebuilds. Incompatible with Subdermal Armor and Dragoon Plating.</p>\n<p>If using the Breaking Your Stuff DLC, the skinweave is now considered to be worth 1,500eb for the purposes of automatic maintenance.</p>\n<p><strong>Enhances:</strong> Skinweave or Fleshweave<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Change the SP on the armor item for the skinweave by hand; an upgrade installed in cyberware can't do it.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; External Body Cyberware).</em></p>"
